on>英偉達（NVIDIA）創辦人黃仁勳11月23日正式回任行政總裁，並重返加州聖克拉拉（Santa Clara）總部。現場員工聚集大廳以如雷掌聲與歡呼迎接，並高喊「我們愛你」表達支持。（X@GavinSBaker影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>黃仁勳王者歸來！分析師神預言「多頭歸隊」網朝聖：未來人</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.050958+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2714,"images":18,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:30:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:19.112374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:36.858588+00:00","content_hash":"a3e6824d3ee4a4fd4fcab808b2dcce3f31354141cd6f6f62862b700b1840f3b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}